The Hilbert-curve order follows D. Hilbert (1891); the check digit is H. M. Damm's
algorithm (2004). Spot codes are N-Ways' own grid of 1/32,768 degree in base 20; the cards
also show the gate's Plus Code (Open Location Code, Apache 2.0 specification by Google).
The national outline and the area seeds are derived from OpenStreetMap
(© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL).
